OL,3,GNEWSAMan learned about gunpowder on
OL,4,AYouTube, trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA self-described "prepper" said he
OL,7,Flearned how to make gunpowder after
OL,8,Fwatching a video on YouTube before then
OL,9,Fbuilding an explosive device in his
OL,10,Fflat.
OL,12,FBen Banham, 38, of Rokescroft in
OL,13,FPitsea, Basildon, said he only planned
OL,14,Fto use the explosives "in a
OL,15,Fpost-apocalyptic scenario" if his
OL,16,Ffamily was in danger.
OL,18,FMore than 80 addresses were evacuated
OL,19,Fon 10 March after bomb disposal teams
OL,20,Ffound a device at the top of Banham's
OL,21,Fthree-bedroom property.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
